[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5582.95, "timestamp": "01:33:02", "text": "工作夥伴、熟人之類的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5586.55, "timestamp": "01:33:06", "text": "知道，我覺得這樣挺好的，因為在某種程度上，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5593.11, "timestamp": "01:33:13", "text": "必須尊重彼此的界線等等。還有社群層面，嗯，界線也很重要。例如，VTuber A 是男性，VTuber B 是女性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5601.35, "timestamp": "01:33:21", "text": "。如果他們合作，可能會有八卦之類的。例如你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5603.91, "timestamp": "01:33:23", "text": "社群會把他們配對什麼的。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5614.709, "timestamp": "01:33:34", "text": "不想這種情況發生，給你的朋友 A 和 B 帶來麻煩。所以你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5617.669, "timestamp": "01:33:37", "text": "必須為你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5620.149, "timestamp": "01:33:40", "text": "社群設定一些界限，這樣他們就"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5624.474, "timestamp": "01:33:44", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "woah loading screen"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5627.59, "timestamp": "01:33:47", "text": "不會越界等等。所有這些都很重要。是的，很多事情都很重要。當"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5629.669, "timestamp": "01:33:49", "text": "你從創作的角度，例如嚴肅的角度看待合作時，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5631.752, "timestamp": "01:33:51", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/DfgfY9LaNdmMq7IPuI2AaA"}]